{"id":"92cb02db803730ae5d4976a50da275d9d1340c5e","url":"https://wine-assembly.berrry.app/","title":"Wine-Assembly — Run Windows 98 apps and games in your browser","site_name":"Zeli","source":"Hacker News · 24h最热","byline":null,"excerpt":"Real Windows 98 .exe files running on an x86 emulator written in WebAssembly. Pinball, SkiFree, Solitaire, Winamp, DirectX games and more, no install.","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"toolbar\">\n      <p><label for=\"app-picker-button\">Program:</label></p>\n      <p>\n      \n      <span>\n        <label>Slice:</label>\n        \n      </span>\n      <span>\n        <label>2D scale:</label>\n        \n      </span>\n      <span>\n        <label>Dedither:</label>\n        \n      </span>\n      <span>\n        <label>CRT:</label>\n        <label title=\"Darken the gaps between the game's logical rows\">Scanlines</label>\n        <label title=\"Apply a subtle RGB phosphor triad\">Mask</label>\n        <label title=\"Bleed a little energy from bright pixels into their neighbours\">Glow</label>\n      </span>\n      <span>\n        <label>MIDI:</label>\n        \n        \n        \n      </span>\n      <span>\n        <label>Profile input</label>\n        \n        <span id=\"input-profile-status\"></span>\n      </span>\n      <span>\n        <label title=\"Write emulator runtime messages to the browser console and debug log pane\">Runtime log</label>\n        <label>FPS graph</label>\n        <label title=\"Fold Caesar III's run-length sprite blit into one dispatch (handler 424). Decode-time, so it steers blocks decoded after the toggle — relaunch for a clean A/B.\">RLE fold</label>\n        <label title=\"Compile proven x87 expression regions and fold contiguous x87 islands. On by default; ?no-x87-fold starts it off. Decode-time, so relaunch for a clean A/B.\">x87 fold</label>\n        <label title=\"Micro-op tier, on by default (?no-uop starts it off): a hot loop head is compiled from x86 into a micro-op program and run in one br_table loop (src/07d, 07e). Applies to running apps immediately, every guest thread included; turning it off drops every program.\">uop tier</label>\n        <label title=\"WebGL accelerates Direct3D and Glide when available, with software fallback. Choose Software to use CPU rendering. Relaunch the app after changing this.\">GPU: </label>\n        <label>Stream</label>\n        <label title=\"Real guest threads, on by default (?no-threads starts this page without them): the guest main thread and every CreateThread target run in Workers. Needs cross-origin isolation, which the page installs once (sw-coi.js) and reloads for. An app with `threads: false` in lib/apps.js always runs cooperatively.\">Threads</label>\n        <span id=\"threads-status\"></span>\n      </span>\n      <span>\n        <label title=\"Delay Direct3D surface readback until pixels are accessed. Applies to running apps using shared WebGL. Disable if a game shows stale graphics.\">Lazy sync</label>\n        <label title=\"Freeze the emulator: no slices run, no frames are drawn and the guest clock stops until somebody steps it. The browser twin of the headless CLI — an agent screenshots, clicks, steps, screenshots again, and the picture cannot change in between. Uncheck to go back to live; the guest sees no time jump either way.\">Frozen</label>\n        \n        <span id=\"frozen-status\"></span>\n      </span>\n      <span>\n        \n      </span>\n      <span>\n        \n      </span>\n      \n      <a href=\"apps/\">Apps</a>\n      <a href=\"design/\">Design</a>\n      <a href=\"story.html\">The Story</a>\n      <span id=\"status\"></span>\n    </p></div><div id=\"content\">\n      <div id=\"screen-wrap\">\n        \n        <!-- The Read Me window: the page's own text, shown the way Windows 98\n             showed Welcome. It is plain HTML, not a guest window, so it is\n             page content a crawler and a screen reader both get; it opens on\n             a first visit and afterwards from its desktop icon or Start. -->\n        \n        \n        \n        <p><span>App is using the full page</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p>Add to Home Screen to hide Safari’s bars too</p>\n        </div>\n      <p>Wine-Assembly v0.2\nResource-aware Win98 emulator\n================================\n</p>\n    </div></DIV>","content_text":"Program: Slice: 2D scale: Dedither: CRT: Scanlines Mask Glow MIDI: Profile input Runtime log FPS graph RLE fold x87 fold uop tier GPU: Stream Threads Lazy sync Frozen Apps Design The Story App is using the full page Add to Home Screen to hide Safari’s bars too Wine-Assembly v0.2 Resource-aware Win98 emulator ================================","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T00:05:01.413Z","ok":true,"blocks":[{"html_en":"<p><label for=\"app-picker-button\">Program:</label></p>","sentences":[{"en":"Program:","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>\n      \n      <span>\n        <label>Slice:</label>\n        \n      </span>\n      <span>\n        <label>2D scale:</label>\n        \n      </span>\n      <span>\n        <label>Dedither:</label>\n        \n      </span>\n      <span>\n        <label>CRT:</label>\n        <label title=\"Darken the gaps between the game's logical rows\">Scanlines</label>\n        <label title=\"Apply a subtle RGB phosphor triad\">Mask</label>\n        <label title=\"Bleed a little energy from bright pixels into their neighbours\">Glow</label>\n      </span>\n      <span>\n        <label>MIDI:</label>\n        \n        \n        \n      </span>\n      <span>\n        <label>Profile input</label>\n        \n        <span id=\"input-profile-status\"></span>\n      </span>\n      <span>\n        <label title=\"Write emulator runtime messages to the browser console and debug log pane\">Runtime log</label>\n        <label>FPS graph</label>\n        <label title=\"Fold Caesar III's run-length sprite blit into one dispatch (handler 424). Decode-time, so it steers blocks decoded after the toggle — relaunch for a clean A/B.\">RLE fold</label>\n        <label title=\"Compile proven x87 expression regions and fold contiguous x87 islands. On by default; ?no-x87-fold starts it off. Decode-time, so relaunch for a clean A/B.\">x87 fold</label>\n        <label title=\"Micro-op tier, on by default (?no-uop starts it off): a hot loop head is compiled from x86 into a micro-op program and run in one br_table loop (src/07d, 07e). Applies to running apps immediately, every guest thread included; turning it off drops every program.\">uop tier</label>\n        <label title=\"WebGL accelerates Direct3D and Glide when available, with software fallback. Choose Software to use CPU rendering. Relaunch the app after changing this.\">GPU: </label>\n        <label>Stream</label>\n        <label title=\"Real guest threads, on by default (?no-threads starts this page without them): the guest main thread and every CreateThread target run in Workers. Needs cross-origin isolation, which the page installs once (sw-coi.js) and reloads for. An app with `threads: false` in lib/apps.js always runs cooperatively.\">Threads</label>\n        <span id=\"threads-status\"></span>\n      </span>\n      <span>\n        <label title=\"Delay Direct3D surface readback until pixels are accessed. Applies to running apps using shared WebGL. Disable if a game shows stale graphics.\">Lazy sync</label>\n        <label title=\"Freeze the emulator: no slices run, no frames are drawn and the guest clock stops until somebody steps it. The browser twin of the headless CLI — an agent screenshots, clicks, steps, screenshots again, and the picture cannot change in between. Uncheck to go back to live; the guest sees no time jump either way.\">Frozen</label>\n        \n        <span id=\"frozen-status\"></span>\n      </span>\n      <span>\n        \n      </span>\n      <span>\n        \n      </span>\n      \n      <a href=\"apps/\">Apps</a>\n      <a href=\"design/\">Design</a>\n      <a href=\"story.html\">The Story</a>\n      <span id=\"status\"></span>\n    </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Slice: 2D scale: Dedither: CRT: Scanlines Mask Glow MIDI: Profile input Runtime log FPS graph RLE fold x87 fold uop tier GPU: Stream Threads Lazy sync Frozen Apps Design The Story","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p><span>App is using the full page</span>\n          \n        </p>","sentences":[{"en":"App is using the full page","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>Add to Home Screen to hide Safari’s bars too</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Add to Home Screen to hide Safari’s bars too","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>Wine-Assembly v0.2\nResource-aware Win98 emulator\n================================\n</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Wine-Assembly v0.2 Resource-aware Win98 emulator ================================","zh":null}]}],"translated":false}